<section class="section section-soft"><div class="reading letter-closing"><h2>From the businesses I’ve built—and the mistakes I’ve made.</h2><p>I’m Adrian. I founded Upstack Studio in 2017 and spent years building software with business owners before choosing to close the agency. Today, I’m building Second Team and a portfolio of my own businesses.</p><p>I write about where AI fits into that work, what I choose to automate and what still needs my attention. Alongside the practical ideas, I share the lessons I’m taking from one business into the next.</p><p>The emails are occasional. I send one when I have a lesson worth sharing, rather than on a fixed schedule.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#join">Get the free emails{{ icon("arrow", "link-arrow") }}</a><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read my ideas first{{ icon("arrow", "link-arrow") }}</a></div><p>Adrian</p></div></section>
